  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the roots of the equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "one positive and one negative",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "both negative",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "both positive",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "both imaginary",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Since, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Hence, both roots of the given equation are positive."
  }
